## A sphere tagged by AreaLightSource inside AttributeBegin/AttributeEnd,
## then a second, plain sphere outside it. AGENTS.md's desync convention:
## AreaLightSource immediately precedes the Sphere under test, so a
## mis-parsed parameter list desyncs it. Not third-party.
Display "arealight_sphere.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 64 64 1
PixelSamples 1 1
Projection "perspective" "fov" [45]
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
Surface "matte"
LightSource "distantlight" 2 "intensity" [1.0] "lightcolor" [1 1 1]
AttributeBegin
AreaLightSource "arealight" 1 "intensity" [10] "lightcolor" [1 1 1]
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
AttributeEnd
Sphere 1 -1 1 360
WorldEnd
